WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:23.303
"Winter won't be fun without Bird," thought Kip.

2
00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:31.198
"I'll write a note to her."

3
00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:38.432
"Dear Bird, Please don't go.

4
00:00:38.433 --> 00:00:41.542
Sledding won't be fun without you.

5
00:00:41.543 --> 00:00:47.946
Ice-skating won't be fun either.

6
00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:52.204
Your friend, Kip."

7
00:00:52.205 --> 00:00:55.479
"I'm sorry, Kip," said Bird.

8
00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:58.051
"But I have to fly south.

9
00:00:58.052 --> 00:01:04.767
It's what birds do."

10
00:01:04.768 --> 00:01:07.085
Kip sang a song to Bird.

11
00:01:07.086 --> 00:01:10.907
"Bird! Oh, Bird! I wish that you'd stay!

12
00:01:10.908 --> 00:01:14.948
We could play in the snow every day!"

13
00:01:14.949 --> 00:01:18.117
"I'm sorry, Kip," said Bird.

14
00:01:18.118 --> 00:01:22.200
"But I have to fly south.

15
00:01:22.201 --> 00:01:51.216
It's what birds do."

16
00:01:51.217 --> 00:01:57.549
Bird was getting ready to leave.

17
00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:01.304
"I have something for you," said Kip.

18
00:02:01.305 --> 00:02:04.851
"It's my lucky acorn."

19
00:02:04.852 --> 00:02:10.055
"Aw," said Bird. "Thank you, Kip.

20
00:02:10.056 --> 00:02:16.391
It will remind me of you."

21
00:02:16.392 --> 00:02:19.841
"I'll see you in the spring," said Kip.

22
00:02:19.842 --> 00:02:22.906
"Have a great winter," said Bird.

23
00:02:22.907 --> 00:02:26.881
Bird took off and flew south.

24
00:02:26.882 --> 00:02:33.405
Kip waved good-bye.
